{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BTPCe5QpvE1793594256.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>滙豐在金融科技周宣布，計劃於北部都會區成立「人工智能及新興科技研究院」，預計明年初投入運作，由科技大學擔任主要學術合作夥伴。</p><p></p><p>研究院初期將聚焦人工智能安全、詐騙偵測、後量子密碼學及區塊鏈等領域，包括研究在「代理式人工智能」時代應對新型詐騙手法，將研發成果應用於各項銀行業務。</p><p></p><p>滙豐指，科技正急速重塑金融服務，香港擁有專業金融服務、國際級研究能力及連繫內地與國際的優勢，為推進創科研究奠下良好基礎。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:47.372189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:18:12.673740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:09.524601+00:00","content_hash":"ff1e6cb5b75a9e78113832b34589cd146fd2d002d5d9fbc4cc51b003e905f263","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:47.372189+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}